WEBVTT

00:12:29.494 --> 00:12:32.422
CC: No, that's so awkward, please don't.

00:12:32.446 --> 00:12:33.496
(Both laugh)

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:38.562
CC: I really encourage a first-name basis
when we're not in front of kids at school.

00:12:38.586 --> 00:12:41.824
AG: Alright, good. It also feels
like I'm in trouble if I say that.

00:12:41.848 --> 00:12:43.676
CC: You're not the only one.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.777
AG: Although her hours
aren't as crazy now,

00:12:45.801 --> 00:12:47.986
she still feels burned out once in awhile,

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:49.820
but she's managed to maintain efficacy

00:12:49.844 --> 00:12:52.346
by keeping track
of her small wins at work.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.736
From attending community
events with parents

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:56.946
and having hallway talks with teachers,

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.963
to my favorite practice of Conrey's.

00:12:58.987 --> 00:12:59.996
(Conrey laughs)